     "text": [
      "Subject: My Amazing Trip Across Pakistan\n",
      "\n",
      "\n",
      "\n",
      "Hi,\n",
      "\n",
      "\n",
      "\n",
      "I hope you're doing well! I just wanted to share some highlights from my recent trip across Pakistan. It has honestly been one of the most amazing experiences of my life.\n",
      "\n",
      "\n",
      "\n",
      "I started in Hunza Valley, where I saw breathtaking mountain views and visited the old Baltit Fort. From there, I traveled to Skardu and spent a day exploring Deosai National Park and the stunning Shangrila Resort.\n",
      "\n",
      "\n",
      "\n",
      "After the north, I went to Lahore, where I visited the Badshahi Mosque and the Lahore Fort. I also spent an evening at the food street in Old Lahore, trying so many delicious local dishes.\n",
      "\n",
      "\n",
      "\n",
      "My favorite part of the trip was Naran and Kaghan Valley, where I saw Lake Saif-ul-Malook surrounded by snow-capped mountains. The water was so clear and the whole place felt like a dream.\n",
      "\n",
      "\n",
      "\n",
      "I ended the trip in Multan, exploring the old shrines and buying some beautiful handmade pottery to bring home.\n",
      "\n",
      "\n",
      "\n",
      "I still can't believe how much I got to see and do in just a few weeks. I have so many photos and stories to share with you when we meet next.\n",
      "\n",
      "\n",
      "\n",
      "Talk soon,\n",
      "\n",
      "Fatima found at line 18\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "data = True\n",
    "word = \"Fatima\"\n",
    "line = 1\n",
    "\n",
    "with open(\"email.txt\", \"r\") as f:\n",
    "    while data:\n",
    "        data = f.readline()\n",
    "        if (\"Fatima\" in data):\n",
    "            print(f\"{word} found at line {line}\")\n",
    "            break\n",
    "        print(data)\n",
    "        line += 1"
   ]
